{"tul": [{"id": "tul", "headword": "तुल्", "headword_slp1": "tul", "fold": "tul", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "तुल् cl. 10. तोलयति, or तुल्˚ (only तुल्˚ also fig.; Ā. MBh.)\nto lift up, raise, Hariv.; R.; Bhaṭṭ. (fut. Pass. तोलयिष्यते);\nto determine the weight of anything by lifting it up, weigh, compare by weighing and examining, ponder, examine with distrust, MBh. &c.;\nto make equal in weight, equal, compare (with instr., e.g. न ब्राह्मणैस् तुलये भूतम् अन्यत्, ‘I do not compare any other being with Brāhmans’, BhP. v; or with an adv. terminating in -वत्), R.; VarBṛS. &c.;\nto counterbalance, outweigh, match, possess in the same degree, resemble, reach, Megh.; ŚārṅgP.;\n (pf. p. तुलित), Bhartṛ. iii & Ragh. xiii, 75;", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "तुल् [cf. Lat. te-tul-i &c.; τλῆ-ναι &c.; Goth. thulan.]", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "tUl", "headword": "तूल्", "headword_slp1": "tUl", "fold": "tul", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "तूल् cl. 1. 10. ˚लति, ˚लयति = निष्कृष्, Dhātup.;\n See also तूण्;\n cf. अनु-तूलय.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "tula": [{"id": "tula", "headword": "तुल", "headword_slp1": "tula", "fold": "tula", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "तुल m. (for ˚ला) the sign Libra, Utp. (on, VarBṛ. xi, xvi, xxiii and VarYogay. iv, 55).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "tulA", "headword": "तुला", "headword_slp1": "tulA", "fold": "tula", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "तुला॑ f. a balance, weight, VS. xxx; ŚBr. xi; Mn. &c. (˚लया धृ or ˚लां with Caus. of अधिरुह्, ‘to hold in or put on a balance, weigh, compare’; ˚लां with Caus. of अधि-रुह्, ‘to risk’, Pañcat. i, 16, 9; ˚लाम् अधि- or आ- or सम्-आ-रुह्, ‘to be in a balance’, be equal with [instr.]; the balance as an ordeal, Yājñ. ii; Mṛcch. ix, 43)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "equal measure, equality, resemblance, Ragh. &c. (˚लाम्